<title>USA: Lucent, ICG sign equipment pact.</title>
<headline>Lucent, ICG sign equipment pact.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc and ICG Communications Inc said on Tuesday they had signed a seven-year, $1 billion equipment purchase agreement for advanced telecommunications products and services.</p>
<p>Lucent Technologies will begin immediately providing ICG with systems, software and services necessary to build and expand ICG's advanced communications networks across the United States, a statement from the companies said.</p>
</text>
